SWARMFIGHTER is released under the Zero-Clause BSD license (0BSD): no
attribution, no notice preservation, no conditions.

That covers the code written for this project: everything under main/, host/,
tools/, components/audio_hal, components/display, components/imu, and the files
core/galaga.c, core/galaga.h, core/galaga_internal.h, core/galaga_video.c,
core/galaga_sound.c.

Two things carry their own terms, listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md:

  * core/z80/ is Marat Fayzullin's portable Z80 emulator. It is free for
    non-commercial use only and may not be distributed commercially. A build
    of this project therefore inherits that restriction.
  * The starfield, sprite, tilemap and custom-chip behavior are written from
    MAME's documentation and code (BSD-3-Clause), which requires the notice to
    be kept.

The Galaga ROM images are not part of this project and are not licensed by
it. They remain the property of their copyright holders.

